OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	Embervault
Description	A single long vault runs from the deep south to the far north, and a river of fire fills its floor. Follow the banks, cross the narrows on stone spans, mine the walls and make a home of every hollow along the way. Build as you like; nothing here ends the game.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
Sandbox	1
SandboxRealm	Embervault
SandboxTarget	38000
SandboxBonus	gold	20000	7500	-	Hold 20000 gold at once
SandboxBonus	rooms	16	7500	-	Own sixteen rooms
SandboxNext	skirmish/GrandDelve.level
[/Info]

