[Triggers]
Region	FirstNarrows	6	72	22	82
Region	MidSpan	24	54	40	64
Region	Hollow	34	50	44	62
Region	NorthVault	14	4	40	16
[Trigger]
Name	hello
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Embervault, master. A river of fire runs the whole length of this vault. Keep to the banks, cross the narrows on the stone spans and mine the walls as you go north.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	narrows
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	FirstNarrows
Action	message	1	The first narrows. The fire fills the floor from wall to wall and only a stone span crosses it.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	span
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	MidSpan
Action	message	1	Rich seams run along these walls. Dig them out before the heat does any harm.
Action	gold	1	250
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hollow
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Hollow
Action	message	1	A hollow beside a small fire pit. A good place for a lair, far from the main path.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	north
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	NorthVault
Action	message	1	The northern vault. A hero portal stands here, so travellers can reach you through the whole length of the corridor.
Action	gold	1	250
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	spanWell
Mode	once
Cond	slabs	1	MidSpan	claimed	>=	20
Action	message	1	The span is claimed and a spring of mana has opened on the near bank. Claim it with a worker.
Action	terrain	34	63	34	63	manawell
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
